1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:18,222
Hold to talk — the mic is open only while held.

2
00:00:18,222 --> 00:00:32,175
ClearVoice writes down what it heard.

3
00:00:32,175 --> 00:00:46,128
One clear sentence, in large text — nothing spoken yet.

4
00:00:46,128 --> 00:00:56,911
Speak it — the voice runs on this laptop, offline.

5
00:00:56,911 --> 00:01:06,424
When it misses, it says so, and you start again.
